{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 發佈新款 iPad mini，配備更大的 8.5 吋 OLED 螢幕、A20 Pro 晶片及 IP67 級防水防塵能力，另有多項規格更新。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"文章配圖\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Maxresdefault-4.jpg\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<h2>10 月 28 日起接受預訂</h2>\n<p>新款 iPad mini 將於 10 月 28 日（星期三）起在 Apple.com 及 Apple Store app 接受預訂，並於 11 月 6 日（星期五）開始送達客戶，同時在 Apple Store 零售店發售。美國售價由 699 美元起。</p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/10/apple-gives-ipad-mini-its-biggest-update-ever/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T13:28:23.622803+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:20:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:58:18.663042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T13:25:41.662341+00:00","content_hash":"4d5470bd3a430d0464f84d34eebba5d29227786e1aaf37d3578258f863d06d94","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T13:28:23.622803+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}